<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Names and descriptions of things the game's rules define (core module): zones, rope stats,
    tackle, battle modes, skins, boat options, shop items, themes, seasons, boards, secrets...
    Core keeps its English names for the server and the tests; the app shows these instead, through
    ui/i18n/CoreText.kt (one mapping per enum or id). Keys: core_<kind>_<id>, with _desc for a
    description and _short for a short form. Keep a term the same everywhere it appears (see the
    glossary in docs/localization.md). Names are labels: they appear on their own (chips, titles,
    lists) or after a colon, never inside a sentence that would have to inflect them.
-->
